      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WRIGLEY FIELD (1) came from worse than midfield with a powerful finish to just miss the placings over 1400m at Eagle Farm two weeks ago. Crying out for 1600m at the fourth run back from a spell. Has his share of weight but this is not strong. DUST CLOUD (2) led all the way and never looked in danger last time out in a midweek Class 1 over this distance at Eagle Farm. Starting to put it all together now and this looks an achievable target. LISTEN JANI (6) has won two on the trot over shorter journeys at Ipswich, racing on the speed on each occasion. New to this trip but she is lightly raced, progressive, and gets in nicely after the claim. GIAPPONESE (4) showed signs he was nearing his peak when close up over the Eagle Farm mile recently. Good enough to test this field. BITTER SPIRIT (8) is fitter for two runs back from a spell and although taking on a better field today he tumbles in the weights which brings him under notice.",
